<title>UK: Deutsche Hypo sets 100 mln mark REX-linked bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hypo sets 100 mln mark REX-linked bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK FRANKFURT</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *5.40	MATURITY    30.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE   REX LINKED    ISS PRICE  99.90     PAY DATE    30.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    FFURT     DENOMS (K) ONE</p>
<p> NOTES     **TO 30.JUL.98 THEN 81 PCT OF 10-YEAR REX YIELD</p>
<p>		 SUB-INDEX THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>		 OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 1185.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
